      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:shuvah_yisrael_ad_adonai">
        <tei:pb n="95" ed="1912" facs="https://archive.org/download/selichothdavidasher1912/page/n192_medium.jpg"/>
        <tei:p>Return, O Israel, unto the Lord thy God; for thou hast fallen by thine iniquity. Thou turnest man to destruction, and sayest, Return, ye children of men. The Lord is nigh to all who call upon him, to all who call upon him in truth. </tei:p>
